Extend P1 DMA-BUF BIND to validated page-backed System-RAM exporters.

Keep the dma_buf, attachment, mapped SG table, and collected pages alive for
the complete binding; reject sub-page, zone-device, DMA-only, and peer-to-peer
layouts that cannot safely be linked into an existing DMA IOVA arena.  Every
failure path unwinds the attachment and references in reverse order.

Provenance: implements the generic page-backed subset of the public CIX BIND
ABI without depending on exporter-private structures.  Broader exporter
support requires a suitable generic DMA-BUF API rather than a CIX cast.

